success_contract:
Return exactly one of these JSON objects, with no other text:
{"success":true}
{"success":false}
Include only the key success. Its value must be a bare lowercase JSON boolean, never a quoted string, number, or null. Do not output reasoning, evidence, markdown, or extra keys.

win_contract:
Return exactly one of these JSON objects, with no other text:
{"winner":"A"}
{"winner":"B"}
{"winner":"Tie"}
Include only the key winner. Its value must be exactly the string A, B, or Tie. Do not output reasoning, markdown, extra keys, null, or any other value.
